So, um, at lunchtime... On a weekday afternoon when you all are at work or school... Yes, on a weekday afternoon, I'll be conducting this Internet Disaster Prevention Drill-noja. Um, I think many people will probably be watching the archive, so, um, I plan to keep it short, finishing in just a few dozen minutes-noja. Please support with a like, thank you-noja!

18
