24
00:05:03,488 --> 00:05:04,808
のじゃ。えー、防災訓練の目的...
Right. Um, purpose of the disaster prevention drill...

25
00:05:04,808 --> 00:05:10,938
「炎上は誰にでも、もちろん自分にも起こりうる」という当事者意識や危機意識を持ってほしい。
"Online controversies can happen to anyone, including myself." I want everyone to have that sense of personal involvement and crisis awareness.

26
00:05:10,938 --> 00:05:15,858
