So today, I'd like to guide you through... introduce that near-miss incident.

62
00:07:06,488 --> 00:07:10,488
うん。インシデントですのじゃ。のじゃ。
Yeah. It's an incident. Indeed.

63
00:07:10,488 --> 00:07:12,988
はい。えー、昨晩何が起きたか。
Okay. Um, what happened last night?

64
00:07:12,988 --> 00:07:21,488
えー、配信が休みで、人間とのコミュニケーションに飢えていた熱千めらは、Twitterで自由気ままに暴れまわっていた。
Um, having a day off from streaming and starving for communication with humans, Achichi Mela was running wild on Twitter to her heart's content.

65
00:07:21,488 --> 00:07:25,988
お主ら、わしのTwitterをフォローしてくれているかな？
Are you guys following my Twitter?

66
00:07:25,988 --> 00:07:31,288
熱千めらはTwitterが大好き！人間と話すのが大好き！
Achichi Mela loves Twitter! She loves talking to humans!

67
00:07:31,288 --> 00:07:35,888
はい。正直に申し上げますとツインハイですのじゃ。
Yes. To be honest, I was tweet-high.

68
00:07:35,888 --> 00:07:39,188
もうバレてると思うけど、あの、かなり控えておりますのじゃ。
I think you already know, but I've actually been holding back quite a bit.

69
